      "name": "Power Drain (Recharge 5-6)",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>When the eredar warlock succeeds on a saving throw against a spell, it can use its reaction to force the caster of the spell to make a Charisma saving throw against its spell DC. On a failed save, the eredar warlock regains one expended spell slot, and the caster can't cast spells other than cantrips for 1 minute.</p>",
